        "id": 1836235
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-28T11:25:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`AeadCtx` doesn\u0027t really implement an AEAD currently, as there\u0027s no way to specify AAD.   \n\n(This in turn means it cannot be used for a `COSE_Encrypt0`, because even an empty \"external\" AAD gets turned into a non-empty AAD for the AES-GCM invocation, because of the `Enc_structure` stuff in RFC 9052 s5.3)",
      "revId": "4acc9bd1172d2be32b3a0474fd4892f7840bc6c4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
